sequenceDiagram
    participant User as Usuario
    participant UI as Pinia Store
    participant Worker as Sync Host
    participant SQLite as Local Storage
    participant Server as Servidor JMAP

    User->>UI: Abre carpeta "Inbox" (1ra vez)
    UI->>Worker: ensureFolderWindow(Inbox)
    Worker->>SQLite: ¿Tenemos vista de Inbox?
    SQLite-->>Worker: NO
    
    Worker->>Server: Email/query (filter: Inbox) + Email/get (refs to query)
    Note right of Worker: Petición JMAP batch (Back-reference)
    
    Server-->>Worker: queryState: "abc", ids: [1,2,3], lista de correos
    
    Worker->>SQLite: Guarda queryState "abc"
    Worker->>SQLite: Inserta correos 1, 2 y 3
    SQLite-->>Worker: OK
    Worker-->>UI: OK
    UI->>SQLite: Lee correos para renderizar
    SQLite-->>UI: Correos
    UI-->>User: Muestra Inbox
